    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d418">

                <pb facs="0522" n="442" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg442"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The German Emperor to
                        President Roosevelt.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Posen</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-09-04"><hi rendition="#italic">September 4,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>With all Americans I praise Providence that saved your life from the terrible
                    accident.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">William I. R.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
